        <body>
            <div xml:id="d499-a1">

                <pb facs="0634" n="566" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg566"/>

                <head>Baron Beust to Count
                        Wydenbruck.</head>
                <p rendition="#center">[Received from Count Wydenbruck 29th May—half past 10 a.
                    m.]</p>
                <p>Renew earnestly the demand of a warm intercession of the American government for
                    release. Answer by telegraph.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>BEUST.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Note.</hi>—The above left at the Department of
                        State by Count Wydenbruck.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
